msgstr "Fragen beantworten"

#: src/Admin/SettingsTools.php:279
msgid "1. Which country profile fits your shop?"
msgstr "1. Welches Länderprofil passt zu deinem Shop?"

#: src/Admin/SettingsTools.php:280
